      'cleanup-unconfirmed':['Partial · cleanup unconfirmed','Both NevroTick services are stopped and their startup is disabled. Clock cleanup is unconfirmed; full disabling is not confirmed. Windows Time was not started by this request. Diagnose current ownership.'],
